WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.220
Let’s work on the first sound in “think”.

00:00:03.470 --> 00:00:05.330
It’s easier than it looks.

00:00:05.660 --> 00:00:08.220
Put the tip of your tongue between your teeth.

00:00:08.480 --> 00:00:11.320
Just the tip, and keep it relaxed.

00:00:11.890 --> 00:00:14.650
Now blow air gently over your tongue.

00:00:14.780 --> 00:00:16.890
No voice, just air.

00:00:17.330 --> 00:00:19.720
If your tongue stays behind your teeth,

00:00:19.750 --> 00:00:22.310
“think” turns into “sink”.

00:00:22.860 --> 00:00:24.040
Try it with me.

00:00:24.350 --> 00:00:25.420
Think.

00:00:26.130 --> 00:00:27.060
Three.

00:00:27.430 --> 00:00:28.630
Thank you.

00:00:29.120 --> 00:00:33.270
Look in a mirror. If you can see the tip of your tongue, you’ve got it.
